+*   Scattering coefficient: $b(x) = C_{sca} \cdot \rho(x)$ [S1].
+*   Optical thickness (homogeneous): $\ell = b \cdot d$ [S1].
+*   Optical thickness (inhomogeneous): $\ell = \int_{0}^{d} b(x) ds$ [S1].
