-        *   **Compute Phase Function:**
-            $$ P = P_{MS}(\theta, \ell) $$
-        *   **Compute Path Curvature:**
-            $$ C = \alpha \cdot \frac{\theta^2}{\ell} $$
-        *   **Compute Weight:**
-            $$ \text{weight} = \exp\left(-\frac{c}{b} \cdot \ell\right) \cdot \exp(-C) \cdot P $$
-        *   **Accumulate:**
-            $$ L_{total} = L_{total} + L \cdot \text{weight} $$
